    {
      "Id": 2006707017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "观众A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "听说是外出演出～，挺少见的呢～。/nEden啊，上次看他们公演的时候就觉得很有创意。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "观众B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "舍人仁花子演天照大神，乌森大黑演大宜都比卖……。/n由Eden描绘的素戋呜尊半生……这场可不能错过。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "观众C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "《素戋呜尊》啊，会是什么样的舞台呢～。/n啊，要开始了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070540",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“关于您的种种所为，我早已有所耳闻……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "203"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“虽说您是为了寻找归宿而来，/n　但真正的目的，莫非是想夺取这片高天原？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "203"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "仁花子",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“啊啊，若真如此，实在太可怕了……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "203"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“这是误会，姐姐……！到底怎样做，你才肯相信我……！？/n　我明白了……！那么，我就为了你立下誓约……！！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“这是什么……你是要我吃这种东西吗！？/n　哪怕饥饿，我也不会舍弃尊严！！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "大黑",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“啊啊，素戋呜尊大人……我不是那个意思……！/n　对不起，对不起！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "202"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“你、你是……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“你就是奇稻田吗？你的父母拜托我来救你。/n　相信我，在这里等着。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“还以为只有巫女，没想到又送来一个饵食……。/n　都给我化作腹中养分吧！！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“哈啊！！！”",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142240_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“什么，那股神气是怎么回事！？简直像神之御子……！？/n　……你这家伙，在跳什么舞！？”",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142240_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“不知姓名的大人，我相信您，把自己的神气托付给您。/n　所以，请您一定打倒这尊荒神！”",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142240_0",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“好！我以手中神剑天羽羽斩起誓！！！”",
      "BackgroundCharacterImageFileName": "142240_0",
      "BgmFileName": "405",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "观众A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好厉害，这是什么压迫感……！/n素戋呜尊仿佛真的就在这里，纵横驰骋……！！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "观众B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "竟然把素戋呜尊的半生这样转化成舞台……/n剧团Eden，原来是基础实力这么强的剧团……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070550",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "观众C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这种高质量的演出，居然能在这里看到……！？/nEden果然好厉害……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006707039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006707,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "神官",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真是精彩的演技，/n能把这样的舞台作为奉纳演出献上……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20067070310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
